  "body": "I hope, this is the right place to ask:\r\n\r\nIs it possible / legal to change the required minimum age of 14 years to say 10 years to use matrix/riot.im services, on a self-hosted server?\r\nOr is this hardcoded in the app (ios, android)?\r\nWhere should I look to change this file on our matrix-synapse server?\r\nBackground: as a school, we would like to self-host messaging between students and teachers\r\n\r\n> You may not use the Website or Services by accepting the terms if: (i) you are not at least 14 years of age and are of legal age to form a binding contract with us; or (ii) you are a person barred from receiving the Services under the laws of the United States or other countries including the country in which you are a resident or from which you use the Services.",
